    "title": "Discount Tire",
    "description": "Discount Tire, America\u2019s largest independent tire retailer offers the largest selection of tires and wheels from the best brands on the market \u2013 all for the lowest prices.\r\n\r\nOur app makes shopping for tires for your car, truck, SUV, crossover, ATV, UTV, trailer or even your golf cart simple and easy. Now you can also find the perfect set of wheels/rims, and can see how they look on your vehicle before you buy them by using with our wheel visualizer. \r\n\r\nOur current rebates and promotions are also easier to find than ever before -- and you can be the first to know about them by opting-in to push notifications.\r\n\r\nFrom our app you can also find, get directions to and contact your closest store, with over 1000 locations nationwide.\r\n\r\nFinancing is also available with our convenient Discount Tire credit card. If you\u2019re already a cardholder, paying your bill has never been easier than through the Discount Tire app! \r\n\"",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discount Tire, America\u2019s largest independent tire retailer offers the largest selection of tires and wheels from the best brands on the market \u2013 all for the lowest prices.<br><br>Our app makes shopping for tires for your car, truck, SUV, crossover, ATV, UTV, trailer or even your golf cart simple and easy. Now you can also find the perfect set of wheels/rims, and can see how they look on your vehicle before you buy them by using with our wheel visualizer. <br><br>Our current rebates and promotions are also easier to find than ever before -- and you can be the first to know about them by opting-in to push notifications.<br><br>From our app you can also find, get directions to and contact your closest store, with over 1000 locations nationwide.<br><br>Financing is also available with our convenient Discount Tire credit card. If you\u2019re already a cardholder, paying your bill has never been easier than through the Discount Tire app! <br>&quot;",
